{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24939","headline":"和李德裕观玉蘂花见怀之作 · 沈传师","name":"和李德裕观玉蘂花见怀之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾对金銮直，同依玉树阴。\n雪英飞舞近，烟叶动摇深。\n素萼年年密，衰容日日侵。\n劳君想华发，近欲不胜簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈传师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}